{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29118","headline":"献韶阳相国崔公 · 许浑","name":"献韶阳相国崔公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一匮爲功极九层，康庄犹自剑棱棱。\n舟回北渚经年泊，门接东山尽日登。\n万国已闻传玉玺，百官犹望啓金縢。\n贤臣会致唐虞世，独倚江楼笑范增。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}